AUDIO: 'this is really cool. Oh, this is for sale." I&nbsp; immediately contacted the realtor and she said,&nbsp;&nbsp; "It\'s a long shot. It\'s um we\'ve got 20 offers."&nbsp; And I said, "But can I look at it?" She said,&nbsp;&nbsp; "If you\'re willing to make the drive, I\'ll make&nbsp; it happen." I stood in the space and I really&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[00:45] [scene:talk]
