AUDIO: 'It\'s been surreal. Uh when I was a kid, we went&nbsp; to visit the Xanadoo homes and they no longer&nbsp;&nbsp; exist. [music] And the Xanadoo homes were&nbsp; very much like Wisconsin Hobbit home. They&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[01:55] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'were experimental homes devoted to the study of&nbsp; um what we would call home automation today and&nbsp;&nbsp; uh the the exploration of the modern home. how&nbsp; your home can be integrated with your lifestyle&nbsp;&nbsp;'

