AUDIO: 'in a way that um is cohesive, not just a box&nbsp; to live in. And I remember this amorphous space&nbsp;&nbsp; that you know as a kid you just want to jump&nbsp; around and play. And one day in I don\'t know&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[02:25] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'maybe in my 20s I I had a flashback and I was&nbsp; like I remember this was like driving down the&nbsp;&nbsp; highway and I called my dad and I\'m like what\'s&nbsp; this white house you brought us to? And he\'s like&nbsp;&nbsp; oh the Santa homes. Do you remember that? And I\'m&nbsp; like, wow. So, fast forward, I get on the phone&nbsp;&nbsp;'

